WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.142
One way to control row multiplication is to summarize first.

00:00:04.142 --> 00:00:08.947
First summarize the fact table to the grain you actually need.

00:00:08.947 --> 00:00:13.132
Then join or pivot from that stable intermediate result.

00:00:13.132 --> 00:00:18.332
This separates the aggregation decision from the presentation decision.

00:00:18.332 --> 00:00:24.079
It also makes the query easier to validate because each stage has a clear grain.
